Package: pastatemp
Type: Package
Title: Paired Air and Stream Temperature Analysis (PASTA) at Annual and Diel Scales
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Danielle", "Hare", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
    email = "maintainer@example.org")
Description: Reads air and stream temperature logger files, sorts loggers into
    air and stream, pairs them by name (logger data as a last resort), and fits
    annual and diel sinusoids to paired records. Reports amplitude ratio, phase
    lag, mean ratio and thermal sensitivity for every site, year and day. The R
    twin of the 'pastatemp' Python package and its 'Streamlit' app: the same
    functions, settings and output tables.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.0.0)
Imports: stats, utils, graphics, grDevices
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), withr, zip
Config/testthat/edition: 3
URL: https://github.com/Haredkb/PASTA_diel
BugReports: https://github.com/Haredkb/PASTA_diel/issues
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
